    9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Implosion] Bloodline Spells initial:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ancestral Memories], advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Extend
    Blood Magic], greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Arcane Countermeasure]
    Blood Magic\u2014Imperious Defense Raw magic emanates from every cell in your
    body, protecting you. Until the start of your next turn, you gain your choice
    of either a +1 status bonus to AC or a +1 status bonus to saving throws. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect:
    Imperial Blood Magic]"
